; ==============================================================================
;  config\texts.rc  -  texts the modules show on their own, in the session's language.
;  step.rc includes it AFTER the theme: these are defaults; a theme that sets one of
;  these keys (or a style its popups use) keeps its own value (the first definition wins).
;  Owned by the repo: deploy and the installer overwrite it.
; ==============================================================================
; Favorites (right-click on a program or a favorite inside a popup)
nPopupPinText "$TxtPinFavorite$"
nPopupUnpinText "$TxtUnpinFavorite$"
; The row a folder popup shows while it is being read
nPopupLoadingText "$TxtLoading$"
PopupStartMenuLoadingText "$TxtLoading$"
